  "title": "Emily Yoo joins SiriusPoint as Chief Operating Officer",
  "summary": "SiriusPoint has today announced the appointment of Emily Yoo as Chief Operating Officer, a newly created role, effective August 10, 2026. Emily will be based in New York. She will join SiriusPoint’s Executive Leadership Team with responsibility for Technology, Claims, Transformation and operational excellence. The creation of the Chief Operating Officer role reflects SiriusPoint’s continued […]",
